{"text":"அல்","lemma":"அல்","gloss":"not"},{"text":"அர்","lemma":"அர்","gloss":"third person plural suffix"}],"gloss":"they are not"},{"surface":"என்று","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"say"},{"text":"து","lemma":"து","gloss":"past participle suffix"}],"gloss":"saying"},{"surface":"யான்","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"யான்","gloss":"I"}],"gloss":"I"},{"surface":"இகழ்ந்தனனே","parts":[{"text":"இகழ்ந்தனனே","lemma":"இகழ்ந்தனனே","gloss":"I disregarded indeed"}],"gloss":"I disregarded indeed","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒல்வாள்","parts":[{"text":"ஒல்","lemma":"ஒல்","gloss":"endure"},{"text":"வ்","lemma":"வ்","gloss":"future tense marker"},{"text":"ஆள்","lemma":"ஆள்","gloss":"she"}],"gloss":"she will endure"},{"surface":"அல்லள்","parts":[{"text":"அல்","lemma":"அல்","gloss":"not"},{"text":"அள்","lemma":"அள்","gloss":"she"}],"gloss":"she is not"},{"surface":"என்று","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"say"},{"text":"று","lemma":"று","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"thinking"},{"surface":"அவர்","parts":[{"text":"அவர்","lemma":"அவர்","gloss":"he (honorific)"}],"gloss":"he"},{"surface":"இகழ்ந்தனரே","parts":[{"text":"இகழ்ந்தனரே","lemma":"இகழ்ந்தனரே","gloss":"he slighted"}],"gloss":"he slighted","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆயிடை","parts":[{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ஆ","gloss":"that"},{"text":"இடை","lemma":"இடை","gloss":"interval"}],"gloss":"meanwhile"},{"surface":"இரு","parts":[{"text":"இரு","lemma":"இரு","gloss":"two"}],"gloss":"two"},{"surface":"பேர்","parts":[{"text":"பேர்","lemma":"பேர்","gloss":"great"}],"gloss":"great"},{"surface":"ஆண்மை","parts":[{"text":"ஆண்மை","lemma":"ஆண்மை","gloss":"strength/pride"}],"gloss":"pride"},{"surface":"செய்த","parts":[{"text":"செய்","lemma":"செய்","gloss":"do"},{"text":"த","lemma":"த","gloss":"past relative participle"}],"gloss":"that made"},{"surface":"பூசல்","parts":[{"text":"பூசல்","lemma":"பூசல்","gloss":"conflict"}],"gloss":"conflict"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நல்லரா","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"நல்","gloss":"good"},{"text":"அரா","lemma":"அரா","gloss":"serpent"}],"gloss":"good cobra"},{"surface":"கதுவி","parts":[{"text":"கதுவு","lemma":"கதுவு","gloss":"bite"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having bitten"},{"surface":"ஆங்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஆங்கு","lemma":"ஆங்கு","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அல்லல்","parts":[{"text":"அல்லல்","lemma":"அல்லல்","gloss":"distress"}],"gloss":"distressed"},{"surface":"நெஞ்சம்","parts":[{"text":"நெஞ்சம்","lemma":"நெஞ்சம்","gloss":"heart"}],"gloss":"heart"},{"surface":"அலமலக்கு","parts":[{"text":"அலமலக்கு","lemma":"அலமலக்கு","gloss":"whirling/distress"}],"gloss":"whirling"},{"surface":"உறுமே","parts":[{"text":"உறு","lemma":"உறு","gloss":"experience"},{"text":"ம்","lemma":"ம்","gloss":"habitual marker"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"suffers"}]}],"literal":"Thinking 'He will not go', I slighted / Thinking 'She will not endure', he slighted / Meanwhile, the conflict made by those two great prides / like a good cobra having bitten, my / distressed heart whirls in pain.","translation":"Thinking 'He will never leave me,' I was proud and careless. Thinking 'She cannot bear my absence,' he too was proud and careless. In the space between these two great prides, a conflict arose. Like one bitten by a deadly cobra, my distressed heart now writhes in agony.","modern":"அவர் என்னை விட்டுப் போகமாட்டார் என்று நான் அலட்சியமாக இருந்தேன். அவள் பிரிவைத் தாங்கமாட்டாள் என்று அவரும் அலட்சியமாக இருந்தார். இந்த இரண்டு பெரிய பெருமைகளுக்கு இடையே ஏற்பட்ட மோதலால், நல்ல பாம்பு கடித்தது போல, என் துன்பப்படும் நெஞ்சம் நிலைதடுமாறித் தவிக்கிறது.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the heroine to her close friend or to herself after the hero has departed on a journey. She reflects on how both she and her lover miscalculated each other's strength and intentions. She assumed his love was too deep for him to ever leave her, so she did not plead with him to stay. He assumed she was too fragile to survive his departure, yet he left anyway, perhaps to test her or out of duty. This clash of 'two great prides' (iru pēr āṇmai) has resulted in her current agony. The pain of separation is compared to the sudden, lethal bite of a cobra (nallarā), whose poison makes her distressed heart whirl in agony.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.29,1.8],[1.8,2.2],[2.2,3.6],[3.6,4.22],[4.22,4.7],[4.7,5.03],[5.12,5.41],[5.41,5.7],[5.7,7.2],[7.2,7.5],[7.5,7.9],[7.9,9.15],[9.15,9.38],[9.38,9.6],[9.6,11.2],[11.2,11.6],[11.87,12.05],[12.05,12.25]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.1],[1.44,2.17],[2.17,2.3],[2.3,3.22],[3.22,4.15],[4.15,4.61],[4.61,6.0],[6.0,6.93],[6.93,7.87],[7.87,8.8],[8.8,9.74],[9.74,10.67],[10.67,11.4],[11.4,11.84],[11.84,12.42],[12.42,13.0],[13.0,13.5],[13.5,13.9],[14.0,14.3]]},"sync":[[["செல்வார்","they will go"]],[["அல்லர்","they are not"],["என்று","saying"]],[["என்று","saying"],["யான்","I"],["இகழ்ந்தனனே","I disregarded indeed"]],[["இகழ்ந்தனனே","I disregarded indeed"]],[["ஒல்வாள்","she will endure"]],[["அல்லள்","she is not"],["என்று","thinking"]],[["என்று","thinking"],["அவர்","he"],["இகழ்ந்தனரே","he slighted"]],[["இகழ்ந்தனரே","he slighted"]],[["ஆயிடை","meanwhile"]],[["இரு","two"],["பேர்","great"]],[["பேர்","great"],["ஆண்மை","pride"]],[["செய்த","that made"]],[["பூசல்","conflict"]],[["நல்லரா","good cobra"],["கதுவி","having bitten"]],[["கதுவி","having bitten"]],[["ஆங்கு","like"],["என்","my"]],[["அல்லல்","distressed"]],[["நெஞ்சம்","heart"]],[["அலமலக்கு","whirling"]],[["அலமலக்கு","whirling"],["உறுமே","suffers"]]]}